{
  "slug": "uk-finance-accounting",
  "name": "Uk Finance Accounting",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Give Claude deep UK accounting knowledge. This plugin replaces the generic finance responses with regulation-aware workflows built specifically for British businesses. It covers journal entries under FRS 102, VAT reconciliation with 9-box MTD returns, Companies House filing (annual accounts, confirmation statements, audit exemption rules), payroll with employer NIC and auto-enrolment pension calculations, and month-end close management with HMRC deadline tracking.\n\nBuilt on and derived from Anthropic's official Finance & Accounting Plugin. Every US-specific element has been replaced with verified UK equivalents: FRS 102 instead of US GAAP, HMRC VAT and Making Tax Digital instead of US sales tax, employer NIC and auto-enrolment pension instead of FICA and 401(k). Four entirely new skills (VAT Reconciliation, MTD Filing, Companies House, PAYE/RTI Payroll) cover workflows that have no US equivalent.\n\nDesigned for sole traders, freelancers, SMBs, and their accountants. Includes 12 skills across 8 slash commands, references only verified FRS 102 standards and HMRC guidance, and ships with 2025/26 tax year rates. Connects to Xero, Sage, FreeAgent, Open Banking, and HMRC MTD API via MCP.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install uk-finance-accounting@claude-community` from `mlobo2012/UK-SMB-Finance-Accounting-Plugin`.\n\nA Claude Code / Cowork plugin for UK finance and accounting workflows — journal entries, reconciliation, purchase invoice scanning, financial statements, VAT, MTD, payroll, Companies House, and internal controls. Built for sole traders, freelancers, and SMBs under FRS 102/IFRS, Companies Act 2006, and HMRC regulations.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
